Z||000002||pollock||04-24-2000||12:40 PM||||Damn Corrados.  I know my fiero wouldn't hang, but i also have a 65 mustang with a really hot 289.<P>One day i was in the stang, about to make a left, and some little punk was next to me revving his corrado.  I was going to ignore it, but he looked at the factory Hi-Po badge on my fender and LAUGHED.  This was unacceptable.  I gave chase, hanging on a super-curvy road winding through traffic (i've got a suspension mod or two).  never really got to race, but i got behind him going up a steep bridge, and lit up both rear tires, already going 35-40mph.  He backed off after that.  <P>Unless you have a fast fiero, i wouldn't pick on a corrado.<BR>||||reg||6
